===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌkɑt.l.ˈiːd.n/|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|cotyledon}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|κοτυληδών||cup-shaped cavity}}, from {{m|grc|κοτύλη||cup}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|botany}} The [[leaf]] of the [[embryo]] of a [[seed]]-[[bearing]] [[plant]]; after [[germination]] it becomes the first leaves of the [[seedling]].

